(text "RAM  512 KB.  A16-A18 come from the bank latch (U2).\n$00:0000-$00:5FFF and $01:0000-$07:FFFF reachable." (at 218.44 50.8 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 6e37362e-ed26-5674-bd93-1d31362e9a82))
(text "~{OEGATE} is shared by the ROM and RAM; their chip enables are mutually\nexclusive, so at most one device drives D0-D7 (decode.pld NOTE 1).\n~{WEGATE} goes only to the RAM.  It includes PHI2, so no write can happen\nwhile D0-D7 carries the bank byte.\nVideo RAM (62256 on ~{VRAMCE}, bank $80) is reserved for future expansion." (at 78.74 175.26 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 63431537-7241-5997-84ea-410626ab7d67))
)
